      //         "Smith Stone Walters specialises in UK immigration, offering expert assistance in corporate transfers and individual visa applications. Our tailored approach merges professional know-how with a personal touch, guaranteeing a smooth, stress-free journey for every client, from start to finish. We have a team of partners and specialists around the world, and we’re good at getting people moving. Get in touch with your local office: Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC) has released details of the 2026-2028 Immigration Levels Plan (Levels Plan). This year’s Levels Plan (here) includes further decreases to temporary resident and international student arrivals and ranges for new arrivals of international students and temporary foreign workers, along with stabilised permanent resident targets. The government is committed to reducing Canada’s temporary population to less than 5% of the total population by the end of 2027. Targets for new temporary resident arrivals are set at 385,000 in 2026 and 370,000 in 2027 and 2028. These figures represent new temporary worker and student arrivals to Canada. The targets for workers are allocated to temporary workers under both the International Mobility Program (IMP) and the Temporary Foreign Worker (TFW) Program. The government is implementing a one-time initiative over a two-year period to streamline the transition of approximately 115,000 Protected Persons in Canada who are already on a pathway to permanent residence and in alignment with their protected status under domestic and international law. The Government will also accelerate the transition of up to 33,000 temporary workers to permanent residency in 2026 and 2027.",
      //         "Targets are not set for visitors arriving with temporary resident visas or electronic travel authorisations (eTAs), permit extensions, in-Canada study/work permit applications and asylum claimants. Smith Stone Walters is now part of Envoy Global. With on-the-ground coverage in 180+ countries, Envoy Global is big enough to support the world’s largest businesses, but small enough to care about each client we serve. To find out more about the enhanced level of global immigration services available to your business, please contact us today. Feel free to choose any Insight issue from the panel below and download onto your device. Get the latest immigration news and views from Smith Stone Walters by signing up to our free email updates. A very pleasant and clear process with Smith Stone Walters. The team were always responsive, helpful, and positive. The team is outstandingly helpful, incredibly professional, exceptionally efficient, and impressively proactive. Their dedication and commitment are truly commendable.",
      //         "Exceptionally efficient and seamless delivery of services. Very friendly and helpful Consultants. The whole team were the epitome of professionalism throughout the process. I would not hesitate to recommend Smith Stone Walters and have already done so. Top notch experience. Thank you for your incredible promptness and patience in answering all the queries. A big thanks to SSW for their support and guidance, it has been a pleasure working with them on my case. Smith Stone Walters is a global immigration practice and has enhanced its capabilities by joining forces with Envoy Global, a recognised leader in global mobility.Learn more about Envoy Global at www.envoyglobal.com"
